{"availability":"available","full":"Zyphra/Zonos","name":"Zonos","description":"Zonos-v0.1 is a leading open-weight text-to-speech model trained on more than 200k hours of varied multilingual speech, delivering expressiveness and quality on par with—or even surpassing—top TTS providers.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":7233,"forks":816,"created":"2025-02-07T00:32:44Z","updated":"2025-03-05T20:02:00Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://playground.zyphra.com/audio","topics":[],"demo":"https://playground.zyphra.com/audio","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:09.501Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:09.501Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:09.501Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:34.893Z","stars":7235,"forks":817},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:34:34.797Z","stars":7236,"forks":816},{"at":"2026-10-06T22:53:16.529Z","stars":7234,"forks":816},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:46:09.501Z","stars":7233,"forks":816}],"technologies":["Python"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:37.423Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Zonos-v0.1 is a leading open-weight text-to-speech model trained on more than 200k hours of varied multilingual speech, delivering expressiveness and quality on par with—or even surpassing—top TTS providers.","Our model enables highly natural speech generation from text prompts when given a speaker embedding or audio prefix, and can accurately perform speech cloning when given a reference clip spanning just a few seconds. The conditioning setup also allows for fine control over speaking rate, pitch variation, audio quality, and emotions such as happiness, fear, sadness, and anger. The model outputs speech natively at 44kHz."],"features":["Zero-shot TTS with voice cloning: Input desired text and a 10-30s speaker sample to generate high quality TTS output","Audio prefix inputs: Add text plus an audio prefix for even richer speaker matching. Audio prefixes can be used to elicit behaviours such as whispering which can otherwise be challenging to replicate when cloning from…","Multilingual support: Zonos-v0.1 supports English, Japanese, Chinese, French, and German","Audio quality and emotion control: Zonos offers fine-grained control of many aspects of the generated audio. These include speaking rate, pitch, maximum frequency, audio quality, and various emotions such as happiness,…","Fast: our model runs with a real-time factor of 2x on an RTX 4090 (i.e. generates 2 seconds of audio per 1 second of compute time)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Zyphra/Zonos/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"23aa4746810b95b2506f413f3d9316cd4f946752cc41d08ef5012e78df188c57","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:53.792Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:30:45.061Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-03-05T20:02:00Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/589b35383495ebe846a52611.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-04T10:38:57.418Z","url":"https://playground.zyphra.com/audio"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://playground.zyphra.com/audio","attemptedAt":"2026-10-04T10:38:57.417Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T10:38:57.417Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-04T10:38:57.417Z","target":"https://playground.zyphra.com/sign-in?redirect_url=https%3A%2F%2Fplayground.zyphra.com%2Faudio","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-11T10:38:57.417Z"},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Zonos-v0.1 is a leading open-weight text-to-speech model trained on more than 200k hours of varied multilingual speech, delivering expressiveness and quality on par with—or even surpassing—top TTS providers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Zyphra/Zonos/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"23aa4746810b95b2506f413f3d9316cd4f946752cc41d08ef5012e78df188c57","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Zyphra/Zonos/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2